- Daily σ ≈ $91.46 × 0.011 ≈ ~$1.00
- 1-week σ ≈ $91.46 × 0.011 × √5 ≈ ~$2.25
- 1-month σ ≈ $91.46 × 0.011 × √21 ≈ ~$4.60
- Slight upward drift assumed given stable utility fundamentals and dividend support
- 90% CI uses ~1.645 standard deviations

